      <div class="Iam">
      <h2 class="treat"id="services" >What we treat</h2>
      <p class="para">Everyday care for children, adults and seniors, all under one roof.</p>
      <div class="total">
      <ul>
        <li><b>Acute illness</b>Fevers, infections, coughs, stomach bugs and rashes, with same-day slots.</li>
        <li><b>Chronic care reviews</b>Diabetes, blood pressure, asthma and thyroid checks, plus repeat prescriptions.</li>
        <li><b>Children’s health</b>Growth checks, vaccinations and school certificates.</li>
        <li><b>Mental wellbeing</b>Talk through stress, low mood, anxiety or poor sleep with a GP</li>
        <li><b>Injury and pain</b>Sprains, joint pain and back problems, with referral to physio when needed.</li>
        <li><b>Preventive checks</b>Annual check-ups, screening and travel health advice.</li>
      </ul>
      </div>
      </div>
      <h2 class="book" id="howitworks">How booking works</h2>
      <p class="short">Three short steps, and most people are done in under two minutes.</p>
      <ol class="list">
        <div class="text-block"><li><p id="p1">Step 1</p><b class="block">Tell us why</b>Describe your symptoms in your own words. Emergency signs are flagged straight away.</li></div>
        <div class="text-block"><li><p id="p2">Step 2</p><b class="block">Get matched</b>We suggest a visit type and how soon to be seen, with the reasons shown.</li></div>
        <div class="text-block"><li><p id="p3">Step 3</p><b class="block">Confirm by text</b>You get a short reminder and can reply to confirm or reschedule.</li></div>
      </ol>
