<h2 class="Q" id="faq">Common Questions</h2>
<div class="faq-item">
  <p class="l question-btn"><img src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcQEuGcHCxxQVEsjuCzBLDj7NIToXfSGa5ky9PCyw4mtgQ&s=10">Do I need an appointment?</p>
<p class="answer">Yes, appointments are recommended so we can serve you better.</p>
<div class="faq-item">
  <p class="l question-btn"><img src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcQEuGcHCxxQVEsjuCzBLDj7NIToXfSGa5ky9PCyw4mtgQ&s=10">Is the visit planner a diagnosis?</p>
<p class="answer">No, the visit planner is only for guidance and not a medical diagnosis.</p>
<div class="faq-item">
  <p class="l question-btn"><img src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcQEuGcHCxxQVEsjuCzBLDj7NIToXfSGa5ky9PCyw4mtgQ&s=10">What should I bring?</p>
<p class="answer">Please bring a valid ID and any previous medical records.</p>
<div class="faq-item">
  <p class="l question-btn"><img src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcQEuGcHCxxQVEsjuCzBLDj7NIToXfSGa5ky9PCyw4mtgQ&s=10">How do I cancel or change a visit?</p>
<p class="answer">You can call our support number or use the online portal to change your visit.</p>
<p class="l1">Reply CHANGE to your reminder text, or call the clinic. Please give at least two hours’ notice.</p>
<h2 class="booking">Book a visit</h2>
<p class="req">Send us a request and we’ll reply with a time. This demo form does not send data anywhere.
</p>
<div class="form-group" id="visit-group">
    <label for="name">Full name</label>
    <input type="text" id="name" placeholder="Enter your full name">

    <label for="number">Mobile Number</label>
    <input type="tel" id="number" placeholder="Enter your mobile number">
    
    <label for="value">What is the visit about?</label>
    <input type="text" id="value" style="width:380px;height:40px;" placeholder="Enter your problem">
  </div>
  
  <button class="send" id="btn">Send request</button>

<p class="clinic">MultiSpeciality Family Clinic is a fictional demonstration website. Not medical advice. Built with AI assistance for a portfolio.</p>


